          <p>Modern data centre and critical infrastructure projects demand careful planning around availability, efficiency, scalability, and security. We provide structured planning services to help organisations build future-ready facilities that avoid unnecessary complexity and cost.</p>
          <p>We begin by defining business, technical, and regulatory requirements, then translate them into practical infrastructure specifications. This includes capacity planning, redundancy strategies, space layout, and technology selections aligned with proven industry standards.</p>
          <p>MEAICON focuses on right-sized designs: we evaluate load profiles, growth projections, and risk tolerance to avoid oversizing power, cooling, and IT systems. The result is an infrastructure that meets availability targets while remaining cost-effective and maintainable over time.</p>
